@page "/error"

<PageTitle>Error · Control Center</PageTitle>

<div class="pa-page">
    <h1 class="pa-error-title">Something went wrong</h1>
    <p>An error occurred while processing your request. The Control Center's log (<code>out.log</code>) has the details.</p>
    <p class="pa-faint">
        Set <code>ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development</code> and restart to see the exception here instead.
        Do not leave Development on for a server others can reach: it shows exception details to anyone.
    </p>
</div>
